<Flow xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata"><apiVersion>66.0</apiVersion><actionCalls><name>CreatePortalUser</name><label>Create Portal User</label><locationX>0</locationX><locationY>0</locationY><actionName>PortalUserRegistration</actionName><actionType>apex</actionType><connector><targetReference>WasTheLoginCreated</targetReference></connector><faultConnector><targetReference>CouldNotRegister</targetReference></faultConnector><flowTransactionModel>CurrentTransaction</flowTransactionModel><inputParameters><name>accountId</name><value><elementReference>GetHolder.Id</elementReference></value></inputParameters><inputParameters><name>email</name><value><elementReference>forT_Email</elementReference></value></inputParameters><storeOutputAutomatically>true</storeOutputAutomatically></actionCalls><actionCalls><name>SendNoMatchEmail</name><label>Send No Match Email</label><locationX>0</locationX><locationY>0</locationY><actionName>emailSimple</actionName><actionType>emailSimple</actionType><connector><targetReference>NoMatch</targetReference></connector><faultConnector><targetReference>NoMatch</targetReference></faultConnector><flowTransactionModel>CurrentTransaction</flowTransactionModel><inputParameters><name>emailAddresses</name><value><elementReference>forT_Email</elementReference></value></inputParameters><inputParameters><name>emailSubject</name><value><stringValue>Your LSBC portal sign-up</stringValue></value></inputParameters><inputParameters><name>emailBody</name><value><elementReference>textT_NoMatchBody</elementReference></value></inputParameters><inputParameters><name>senderType</name><value><stringValue>OrgWideEmailAddress</stringValue></value></inputParameters><inputParameters><name>senderAddress</name><value><stringValue>jvasquez+lsbc@journeyblazers.com</stringValue></value></inputParameters><storeOutputAutomatically>true</storeOutputAutomatically></actionCalls><decisions><name>IsALicenseFound</name><label>Is a License Found?</label><locationX>0</locationX><locationY>0</locationY><defaultConnector><targetReference>SendNoMatchEmail</targetReference></defaultConnector><defaultConnectorLabel>No</defaultConnectorLabel><rules><name>LicenseFound</name><conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic><conditions><leftValueReference>GetLicense.Id</leftValueReference><operator>IsNull</operator><rightValue><booleanValue>false</booleanValue></rightValue></conditions><connector><targetReference>GetHolder</targetReference></connector><label>Yes</label></rules></decisions><decisions><name>DoTheDetailsMatch</name><label>Do the Details Match?</label><locationX>0</locationX><locationY>0</locationY><defaultConnector><targetReference>SendNoMatchEmail</targetReference></defaultConnector><defaultConnectorLabel>No</defaultConnectorLabel><rules><name>Match</name><conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic><conditions><leftValueReference>forB_DetailsMatch</leftValueReference><operator>EqualTo</operator><rightValue><booleanValue>true</booleanValue></rightValue></conditions><connector><targetReference>SaveMobileNumber</targetReference></connector><label>Yes</label></rules></decisions><decisions><name>WasTheLoginCreated</name><label>Was the Login Created?</label><locationX>0</locationX><locationY>0</locationY><defaultConnector><targetReference>CouldNotRegisterMessage</targetReference></defaultConnector><defaultConnectorLabel>No</defaultConnectorLabel><rules><name>Created</name><conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic><conditions><leftValueReference>CreatePortalUser.userId</leftValueReference><operator>IsNull</operator><rightValue><booleanValue>false</booleanValue></rightValue></conditions><connector><targetReference>Registered</targetReference></connector><label>Yes</label></rules></decisions><description>Portal sign-up, open to guests. A licensee enters their license or permit number, last name (or the name they were licensed under) and the ZIP code of the mailing address on file. If all three match an active Louisiana license on a person account, their mobile number is saved and a portal login is created (Salesforce emails a link to set the password). If not, they are emailed that the details could not be matched and asked to call the Board. The Social Security number is never asked for. Runs in system context because guests have no record access.</description><environments>Default</environments><formulas><name>forT_LicenseNumber</name><dataType>String</dataType><expression>UPPER(TRIM({!R_LicenseNumber}))</expression></formulas><formulas><name>forT_Email</name><dataType>String</dataType><expression>LOWER(TRIM({!R_Email}))</expression></formulas><formulas><name>forB_DetailsMatch</name><description>True when the holder is a person whose last or maiden name and mailing ZIP code match what was entered.</description><dataType>Boolean</dataType><expression>AND({!GetHolder.IsPersonAccount}, OR(UPPER(TRIM({!R_LastName})) = UPPER({!GetHolder.LastName}), UPPER(TRIM({!R_LastName})) = UPPER(BLANKVALUE({!GetHolder.MaidenName__pc}, &quot;~&quot;))), LEFT(BLANKVALUE({!GetHolder.PersonMailingPostalCode}, &quot;&quot;), 5) = TRIM({!R_Zip}))</expression></formulas><formulas><name>forT_Mobile</name><description>The new mobile number, or the one on file if none was entered.</description><dataType>String</dataType><expression>IF(ISBLANK(TRIM({!R_Mobile})), {!GetHolder.PersonMobilePhone}, TRIM({!R_Mobile}))</expression></formulas><interviewLabel>Screen Flow: Account Portal Registration {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel><isAdditionalPermissionRequiredToRun>true</isAdditionalPermissionRequiredToRun><label>Screen Flow: Account Portal Registration</label><processMetadataValues><name>BuilderType</name><value><stringValue>LightningFlowBuilder</stringValue></value></processMetadataValues><processMetadataValues><name>CanvasMode</name><value><stringValue>AUTO_LAYOUT_CANVAS</stringValue></value></processMetadataValues><processMetadataValues><name>OriginBuilderType</name><value><stringValue>LightningFlowBuilder</stringValue></value></processMetadataValues><processType>Flow</processType><recordLookups><name>GetLicense</name><label>Get License</label><locationX>0</locationX><locationY>0</locationY><assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>false</assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound><connector><targetReference>IsALicenseFound</targetReference></connector><filterLogic>and</filterLogic><filters><field>Identifier</field><operator>EqualTo</operator><value><elementReference>forT_LicenseNumber</elementReference></value></filters><filters><field>Status</field><operator>EqualTo</operator><value><stringValue>Active</stringValue></value></filters><filters><field>JurisdictionState</field><operator>IsNull</operator><value><booleanValue>true</booleanValue></value></filters><filters><field>JurisdictionCountry</field><operator>IsNull</operator><value><booleanValue>true</booleanValue></value></filters><getFirstRecordOnly>true</getFirstRecordOnly><object>BusinessLicense</object><queriedFields>Id</queriedFields><queriedFields>AccountId</queriedFields><storeOutputAutomatically>true</storeOutputAutomatically></recordLookups><recordLookups><name>GetHolder</name><label>Get License Holder</label><locationX>0</locationX><locationY>0</locationY><assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>false</assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound><connector><targetReference>DoTheDetailsMatch</targetReference></connector><filterLogic>and</filterLogic><filters><field>Id</field><operator>EqualTo</operator><value><elementReference>GetLicense.AccountId</elementReference></value></filters><getFirstRecordOnly>true</getFirstRecordOnly><object>Account</object><queriedFields>Id</queriedFields><queriedFields>IsPersonAccount</queriedFields><queriedFields>FirstName</queriedFields><queriedFields>LastName</queriedFields><queriedFields>MaidenName__pc</queriedFields><queriedFields>PersonMailingPostalCode</queriedFields><queriedFields>PersonMobilePhone</queriedFields><storeOutputAutomatically>true</storeOutputAutomatically></recordLookups><recordUpdates><name>SaveMobileNumber</name><label>Save Mobile Number</label><locationX>0</locationX><locationY>0</locationY><connector><targetReference>CreatePortalUser</targetReference></connector><filterLogic>and</filterLogic><filters><field>Id</field><operator>EqualTo</operator><value><elementReference>GetHolder.Id</elementReference></value></filters><inputAssignments><field>PersonMobilePhone</field><value><elementReference>forT_Mobile</elementReference></value></inputAssignments><object>Account</object></recordUpdates><runInMode>SystemModeWithoutSharing</runInMode><screens><name>Register</name><label>Sign Up</label><locationX>0</locationX><locationY>0</locationY><allowBack>false</allowBack><allowFinish>true</allowFinish><allowPause>false</allowPause><connector><targetReference>GetLicense</targetReference></connector><fields><name>R_Intro</name><fieldText>&lt;p&gt;Create your login for the LSBC licensing portal. You need the number of a Louisiana license or permit you hold now.&lt;/p&gt;</fieldText><fieldType>DisplayText</fieldType></fields><fields><name>R_LicenseNumber</name><dataType>String</dataType><fieldText>License or permit number</fieldText><fieldType>InputField</fieldType><helpText>As printed on your license, for example L0123456.</helpText><isRequired>true</isRequired></fields><fields><name>R_LastName</name><dataType>String</dataType><fieldText>Last name</fieldText><fieldType>InputField</fieldType><helpText>Your last name as it is on your license, or the name you were first licensed under.</helpText><isRequired>true</isRequired></fields><fields><name>R_Zip</name><dataType>String</dataType><fieldText>ZIP code</fieldText><fieldType>InputField</fieldType><helpText>The ZIP code of the mailing address the Board has for you.</helpText><isRequired>true</isRequired><validationRule><errorMessage>Enter the 5-digit ZIP code.</errorMessage><formulaExpression>REGEX(TRIM({!R_Zip}), &quot;\\d{5}&quot;)</formulaExpression></validationRule></fields><fields><name>R_Email</name><dataType>String</dataType><fieldText>Email address</fieldText><fieldType>InputField</fieldType><helpText>Your own email address. It becomes your username.</helpText><isRequired>true</isRequired><validationRule><errorMessage>Enter a valid email address.</errorMessage><formulaExpression>REGEX(TRIM({!R_Email}), &quot;[^@\\s]+@[^@\\s]+\\.[^@\\s]+&quot;)</formulaExpression></validationRule></fields><fields><name>R_Mobile</name><dataType>String</dataType><fieldText>Mobile number</fieldText><fieldType>InputField</fieldType><helpText>The Board may text you about your license in future.</helpText><isRequired>false</isRequired></fields><nextOrFinishButtonLabel>Sign up</nextOrFinishButtonLabel><showFooter>true</showFooter><showHeader>false</showHeader></screens><screens><name>Registered</name><label>Registered</label><locationX>0</locationX><locationY>0</locationY><allowBack>false</allowBack><allowFinish>true</allowFinish><allowPause>false</allowPause><fields><name>RG_Message</name><fieldText>&lt;h2&gt;Check your email&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your login has been created, {!GetHolder.FirstName}. We&apos;ve sent an email to &lt;b&gt;{!forT_Email}&lt;/b&gt; with a link to set your password. Then use &lt;b&gt;Log in&lt;/b&gt; at the top of the page.&lt;/p&gt;</fieldText><fieldType>DisplayText</fieldType></fields><showFooter>true</showFooter><showHeader>false</showHeader></screens><screens><name>CouldNotRegisterMessage</name><label>Could Not Register</label><locationX>0</locationX><locationY>0</locationY><allowBack>false</allowBack><allowFinish>true</allowFinish><allowPause>false</allowPause><fields><name>CNR_Message</name><fieldText>&lt;h2&gt;We couldn&apos;t create your login&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;{!CreatePortalUser.errorMessage}&lt;/p&gt;</fieldText><fieldType>DisplayText</fieldType></fields><showFooter>true</showFooter><showHeader>false</showHeader></screens><screens><name>CouldNotRegister</name><label>Could Not Register (Error)</label><locationX>0</locationX><locationY>0</locationY><allowBack>false</allowBack><allowFinish>true</allowFinish><allowPause>false</allowPause><fields><name>CNRE_Message</name><fieldText>&lt;h2&gt;We couldn&apos;t create your login&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Please try again later, or call the Board at 225-756-3404.&lt;/p&gt;</fieldText><fieldType>DisplayText</fieldType></fields><showFooter>true</showFooter><showHeader>false</showHeader></screens><screens><name>NoMatch</name><label>No Match</label><locationX>0</locationX><locationY>0</locationY><allowBack>false</allowBack><allowFinish>true</allowFinish><allowPause>false</allowPause><connector><targetReference>Register</targetReference></connector><fields><name>NM_Message</name><fieldText>&lt;h2&gt;We couldn&apos;t confirm your details&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;The details you entered don&apos;t match a current Louisiana license on file, so we can&apos;t create your login. We&apos;ve emailed you what to check.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If your name or address has changed, or you still can&apos;t sign up, call the Board at 225-756-3404.&lt;/p&gt;</fieldText><fieldType>DisplayText</fieldType></fields><nextOrFinishButtonLabel>Try again</nextOrFinishButtonLabel><showFooter>true</showFooter><showHeader>false</showHeader></screens><start><locationX>0</locationX><locationY>0</locationY><connector><targetReference>Register</targetReference></connector></start><status>Active</status><textTemplates><name>textT_NoMatchBody</name><description>The email sent when the details can&apos;t be matched. It doesn&apos;t say which detail was wrong.</description><isViewedAsPlainText>true</isViewedAsPlainText><text>Hello,

We could not create your login for the Louisiana State Board of Cosmetology licensing portal, because the details you entered did not match a current Louisiana license on file.

Please check that you entered:
- the number of a license or permit you hold now,
- your last name as it is on your license, or the name you were first licensed under, and
- the ZIP code of the mailing address the Board has for you.

If your name or address has changed, or you still can&apos;t sign up, please call the Board at 225-756-3404.

Louisiana State Board of Cosmetology</text></textTemplates></Flow>
